incorporation_legal_framework.pro_forma_first_board_resolution_en:
RESOLVED, that the Articles of Incorporation be adopted;
RESOLVED, that the registered office be at [Alberta address];
RESOLVED, that [Name] be appointed Director, President, Secretary and Treasurer;
RESOLVED, that 1,000 common shares at $1 par value be subscribed by the incorporator;
RESOLVED, that initial by-laws be adopted;
RESOLVED FURTHER that incorporator's pre-incorporation actions be ratified.

This resolution sets up statutory incorporation, share structure, registered office, and officer appointments for the Intellectual Property HoldCo.
